<%doc>

=head1 NAME

/cview/index.mas - a mason component to show information about available maps.

=head1 DESCRIPTION

A Mason component that displays an html page with links to all SGN maps and related information. 

Required parameters:

=over 2

$map_by_species - a hashref with map information to display

$default_map_id - the map_id of the map to be displayed by default

=back

=head1 AUTHOR

Initial version by Robert Ahrens, later maintained by John Binns.

Mason version by Lukas Mueller <lam87@cornell.edu>

February 2010

Refactored for Catalyst Feb 2011

=cut

</%doc>

<%args>
$map_by_species
$map_url
$chr_url
$comp_maps_url
$default_map_id => 9

</%args>

<& /page/page_title.mas, title=>"可用圖譜(Available Maps)" &>
<div class="container-fluid">

<%perl>
# Show a blue section html with the system maps
# organized by species.
#
my $d ='';
foreach my $s (sort { @{$map_by_species->{$a}} <=> @{$map_by_species->{$b}} } keys %$map_by_species) {
  $d .= "<b>$s</b><br />\n";
  $d .= join('<br />' ,  sort @{ $map_by_species->{$s} } );
  $d .= "<br /><br />";
}

my $submit = qq | <b>[<a href="/cview/help/map_submission">提交新圖譜(Submit New Map)</a>]</b> |;

</%perl>

<&| /page/info_section.mas, collapsible=>1, collapsed=>0, title=>"互動式圖譜(Interactive Maps)", subtitle=>$submit &>
<br/>
<% $d %>
</&>

<!-- Comparative maps -->

<&| /page/info_section.mas, collapsible=>1, collapsed=>0, title=>"比較圖譜(Comparative Maps)" &>

<br />
<a href="<% $chr_url %>"><b>互動式比較地圖檢視器(Interactive comparative map viewer)</b></a>:
同時檢視來自兩個不同圖譜的兩條染色體；顯示染色體之間的關係以及其他資訊，例如相關的物理圖譜、近交品系與尺規(View two chromosomes from two different maps at the same time; it displays the relationships between the chromosomes and additional information such as associated physical map, inbred lines, and rulers)。<br /><br />
<b>範例(Examples)</b>:
<ul>
<li><a href="<% $chr_url %>?show_IL=1&amp;map_id=5&amp;chr_nr=1&amp;comp_map_id=3&amp;comp_chr=1">Tomato EXPEN 1992 vs Potato TXB 1992</a><br /></li>
  <li><a href="<% $chr_url %>?map_id=<% $default_map_id %>&amp;chr_nr=1&amp;comp_map_id=6&amp;comp_chr=1&amp;show_ruler=1&amp;show_physical=1">Tomato EXPEN 2000 vs Eggplant-LXM 2002</a></li>
<li><a href="<% $chr_url %>?map_id=3&amp;chr_nr=1&amp;comp_map_id=6&amp;comp_chr=1&amp;show_ruler=1">Potato TXB 1992 vs Eggplant-LXM 2002</a></li>
</ul>

<a href="<% $comp_maps_url %>?center_map=<% $default_map_id %>&amp;right_map=3"><b>比較完整圖譜(Compare entire maps)</b></a>:
為了更好地了解兩個（或三個）圖譜如何相互關聯，請使用整個圖譜的縮小檢視。一次最多可以同時顯示 3 個圖譜。可以在顯示畫面頂部選擇要顯示的圖譜(To get a better view how two (or three) maps relate to each other, take a zoomed out view of the entire map. A maximum of 3 maps can be shown together at one time. The maps to be displayed can be selected on the top of the display)。  <br /><br />
<b>範例(Examples)</b>:
<ul>
<li><a href="/cview/view_maps.pl?center_map=5&amp;right_map=3">Tomato EXPEN 1992 vs Potato TXB 1992</a></li>
<li><a href="/cview/view_maps.pl?left_map=5&amp;center_map=3&amp;right_map=6">Eggplant LXM 2002 vs Tomato EXPEN 1992 vs Potato TXB 1992 (三方比較)(three-way comparison)</a></li>
</ul>
<br />
若要深入了解比較地圖檢視器，請閱讀<a href="/help/cview">說明頁面(help page)</a>(For more on the comparative map viewer, read the help page)。

</&>

<!--  Static maps -->

<&| /page/info_section.mas, collapsible=>1, collapsed=>0, title=>'靜態圖譜(Static Maps)' &>
<br/>
<p>
<b>番茄圖譜(Tomato maps)</b><br />
<i>L. esculentum x L. pennellii</i> maps:<br />
<a href='/maps/tomato_arabidopsis/index.pl'>番茄 - 擬南芥同線性圖譜(Tomato - Arabidopsis synteny map)</a><br />
<a href='/maps/pepper_korea/index.pl'>Pepper SNU2 map</a><br />
<a href='/maps/pennellii_il/index.pl'>近等基因系 (IL) 圖譜(Isogenic Line (IL) map)</a><br />
<a href="/maps/lpimp_ibl/index.pl">Lycopersicon pimpinellifolium Inbred Backcross Lines (IBLs)</a>
</p>
</&>

<!-- JavaScript function for help files. -->
<script language='javascript' type=\"text/javascript\">
<!--\n
function commercial(Page)\n{
   var new_win = open(Page, 'EXTRA', \"scrollbars=yes,resizable=yes,height=500,width=720\")
}\n// -->
</script>

</div>
